  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Dasari Narsaiah vs The State Of Telangana on 10 November, 2022 Bench: A.Abhishek Reddy, Juvvadi Sridevi The Hon'Ble Sri Justice A.Abhishek Reddy And The Hon'Ble Smt Justice Juvvadi Sridevi Writ Petition No.35458 of 2022 Order:",
    "facts": "The case of the petitioner is that based on three crimes viz., Crime No.132 of 2022 of Adibatla Police Station registered for the offence under Section 392 I.P.C., Crime No.130/2022 of Bhongiri Rural Police Station registered for the offences under Sections 457, 380 and 411 I.P.C., and Crime No.135/2022 of Valigonda Police Station registered for the offences under Sections 356 and 379 I.P.C, the respondent No.2 has passed the impugned detention order dated 11.08.2022.",
